# Structure only (ADR-147 decision 13): no weight, floor or ceiling until plan 8 has measured them. Accounting is on so that it can.
[Unit]
Description=Unheaded: what runs on every host
Documentation=https://github.com/unheaded/unheaded/blob/develop/docs/adr/ADR-147-every-service-earns-its-place.md

[Slice]
CPUAccounting=yes
MemoryAccounting=yes
IOAccounting=yes
TasksAccounting=yes
